摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Lightweight agent multiplexer, all in one Web dashboard","id":"gh:1253161550","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"StarAgent","slug":"SiriusNEO/StarAgent","topics":["agent","ai","claude-code","codex","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm","openai","python","tailscale","tmux"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Lightweight agent multiplexer, all in one Web dashboard"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"StarAgent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"简体中文"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"> ⚠️ This project is currently intended for personal use and is under active development. A stable v"},{"id":"p4s2","text":"ersion will be released later."},{"id":"p5s1","text":"> ⚠️ This project was primarily built with vibe coding and may contain potential bugs. Please keep t"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"his in mind before using it."},{"id":"p6s1","text":"StarAgent is a local-first **Agent Harness Launcher** and an optional multi-Node Hub for managing co"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ding agent sessions. It reflects my own best practices for using multiple agents:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"> **We need a lightweight persistent terminal wrapper for Codex / Claude Code that supports cross-ma"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"chine connections and can be accessed from any device.**"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Design Principles"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"It is built around a few practical needs that show up when using coding agents day to day:"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"- We often run multiple agent CLI instances in parallel across different working directories, each h"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"andling a separate task. We need one place to check their status and interact with them in real time"},{"id":"p10s3","text":".\n- We want to interact with our agents anywhere, anytime, and on any device. And the sessions shoul"},{"id":"p10s4","text":"d be consistent.\n- Agent CLI sessions should be long-lived, so we do not need to keep typing `/resum"},{"id":"p10s5","text":"e consistent.\n- Agent CLI sessions should be long-lived, so we do not need to keep typing `/resume`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"Based on hands-on experience, StarAgent uses the simplest effective stack for this workflow, making "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"it feel like managing a small team of coding agents:"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- **Platform-native persistent terminals**. Windows Desktop hosts sessions with ConPTY; Linux, macOS"},{"id":"p12s2","text":", and server Nodes use long-lived tmux sessions. See SESSIONS.md for the session model."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"- **Cross-machine connectivity via Tailscale**. Tailscale provides a secure and unified network laye"},{"id":"p13s2","text":"r across machines. See tailscale/README.md for the Tailscale setup."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **Unified management through a web dashboard**. The web dashboard lets you control agents from any"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" device with a browser, including phones and laptops, without installing extra software."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"- **Node-local account and launch control**. Sign in or switch credential sources from the Harness p"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"age, browse the models exposed by each CLI, and choose model plus reasoning-effort defaults for new "},{"id":"p15s3","text":"Sessions without rewriting vendor configuration files."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"Running `staragent` opens the single-Node `StarAgent Launcher`, scoped directly to the current machi"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ne. When cross-machine management is needed, `staragent hub` keeps the existing Hub experience: choo"},{"id":"p16s3","text":"se a Node, then enter the same Node workspace used by Launcher.\nFor the technical architecture, see "},{"id":"p16s4","text":"enter the same Node workspace used by Launcher.\nFor the technical architecture, see ARCHITECTURE.md."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Preview"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"The screenshots below use sanitized demo data. The anime-inspired background is optional —\nupload an"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"y image from the theme menu, then pair it with a color theme and glass surfaces."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Select a connected Node, then manage that machine's sessions in a focused workspace:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"Each session includes a lightweight chat console for interacting with agents, plus a Terminal and Fi"},{"id":"p20s2","text":"le Explorer.\nSession detail pages keep an IM-style switcher on the left for moving between that Node"},{"id":"p20s3","text":"'s sessions without\nreturning to the session table; on narrow screens it collapses into a drawer."},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Inspect Agent CLI availability, login state, installed Skills, streamlined install/update paths, and"},{"id":"p21s2","text":"\nlaunch presets on the selected Node:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**NOTICE:** Source-installed Linux/macOS Nodes keep their SSH-friendly tmux backend. Self-contained\n"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"Desktop packages instead own native PTY Sessions (ConPTY on Windows). In both cases, closing a brows"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"er\nor workspace view only detaches the view; it does not stop the Agent Session."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Launcher"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Install from a checkout, then start StarAgent with no subcommand:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"Launcher starts in the supervised `staragent-launcher` tmux system session and opens the local\nHarne"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"ss workspace at `http://127.0.0.1:8080`. Under SSH it prints the URL without trying to open a\nbrowse"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"r. Use `staragent --no-open` to explicitly disable browser handoff."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"Launcher is the normal single-machine experience. It opens directly on the local Agents catalog;\nSes"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"sions, Logs, Settings, and Current Node details use the same views as a Node selected in Hub.\nCurren"},{"id":"p27s3","text":"t Node also reports the terminal, networking, and package-runtime dependencies on that machine\nand o"},{"id":"p27s4","text":"ffers reviewed platform-native installation paths where available."},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Desktop"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"A Tauri desktop app is available for Windows, Linux, and macOS. It can start the local Launcher or\nc"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"onnect to an existing Hub. Every desktop package includes the StarAgent Python runtime and a native\n"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"terminal backend: Windows uses ConPTY, while Linux and macOS use the operating system PTY API. WSL,\n"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"Python, StarAgent, and tmux do not need to be installed separately."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"### Download a prebuilt package"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"Open the latest GitHub Release, expand\n**Assets**, and download the package for your system:"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| System | Release asset | Install |"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"| Windows x64 | `*-setup.exe` | Run the per-user installer |\n| Linux x64 | `*.AppImage` | Make it ex"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ecutable and run it |\n| Debian / Ubuntu x64 | `*.deb` | Run `sudo apt install ./<downloaded-file>.de"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"b` |\n| macOS Apple Silicon | `*_aarch64.dmg` | Open the DMG and drag StarAgent to Applications |\n| m"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"acOS Intel | `*_x64.dmg` | Open the DMG and drag StarAgent to Applications |"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"Do not confuse GitHub's automatically generated **Source code** archives with desktop installers. If"},{"id":"p34s2","text":"\na release contains only those archives, it predates desktop packaging; use a newer release, a CI\nar"},{"id":"p34s3","text":"tifact, or the source installation above. `v0.1.1` and earlier do not contain desktop installers."},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Updater-enabled desktop releases offer **Stable** and **Nightly** channels and check the selected on"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"e\nat startup. Stable follows normal Releases; Nightly follows signed builds from relevant `dev` comm"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"its.\nA prompt shows the version, source commit, and release notes, and installation only starts afte"},{"id":"p35s4","text":"r you\nconfirm **Update & restart**. If your current installation predates the updater, install the f"},{"id":"p35s5","text":"irst\nupdater-enabled release manually once."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The same files can be downloaded with the GitHub CLI:"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"For an unreleased development build, select Nightly in the app. Individual build artifacts remain in"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"\nthe Desktop workflow as\n`staragent-windows-x64`, `staragent-linux-x64`, `staragent-macos-arm64`, an"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"op workflow as\n`staragent-windows-x64`, `staragent-linux-x64`, `staragent-macos-arm64`, and\n[该节后续省略]"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
